            <h3>Brent-to-Retail Correlation Analysis</h3>
            <p>The correlation between Brent Crude and retail petrol prices is notably <strong>weak overall</strong> (average r = {stats['avg_corr_petrol']}), indicating that local factors—subsidies, taxes, exchange rates—heavily modulate the transmission of global crude prices to consumers.</p>

