        </section>

        <section id="income">
            <h2>5. Fuel Affordability by Income Level</h2>

            <p>Fuel pricing affects countries differently based on their economic capacity. This section analyzes how income classification shapes fuel pricing, tax burden, and affordability.</p>

            <div class="two-col">
                <div>
                    <h3>Petrol Prices by Income Level</h3>
                    <div class="chart-container">
                        <img src="data:image/png;base64,{charts['income_analysis']}" alt="Income Analysis">
